    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "phpunit/phpunit is in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/ConfigController.php:104 OCP\\IAppConfig::deleteKey(): deprecated since Nextcloud 13; use method deleteAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig",
        "lib/Controller/ConfigController.php:105 OCP\\IAppConfig::deleteKey(): deprecated since Nextcloud 13; use method deleteAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 uses in 1 file of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 34 to 36. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Controller/ConfigController.php:104 OCP\\IAppConfig::deleteKey(): deprecated since Nextcloud 13; use method deleteAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig",
        "  lib/Controller/ConfigController.php:105 OCP\\IAppConfig::deleteKey(): deprecated since Nextcloud 13; use method deleteAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "transaction-manual",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Db/TrackPositionMapper.php:161"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 transaction is opened and closed by hand. The trait TTransactional has atomic() since Nextcloud 24 and atomicRetry() since Nextcloud 27, which repeats a transaction that ran into a deadlock, as the manual recommends.",
        "  lib/Db/TrackPositionMapper.php:161"
      ]
    },
